OL,3,GNEWSAFairy trail 'too much' to manage  
OL,4,Adue to vandalism                       
OL,6,FA vandal-hit family attraction is set  
OL,7,Fto wind down after its founder said it 
OL,8,Fwas becoming "too much" to manage.     
OL,10,FThe Foss Fairy Trail was created by    
OL,11,Fvolunteers in York during the Covid-19 
OL,12,Fpandemic, to provide something positive
OL,13,Ffor the community.                     
OL,15,FHowever, over the years, founder Tracy 
OL,16,FOstle estimated there had been about   
OL,17,F150 reported incidents of vandalism and
OL,18,Fanti-social behaviour on the trail.    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
