OL,3,GNEWSAFairy trail 'too much' to manage  
OL,4,Adue to vandalism                       
OL,6,FAlthough she will still be involved    
OL,7,Fwith maintaining the riverside pathway,
OL,8,FOstle said it was "time to let go" of  
OL,9,Fthe fairy houses and other features.   
